name exframe
category Package
revision 53911
shortdesc Framework for exercise problems
longdesc This LaTeX2e package provides a general purpose framework to
longdesc describe and typeset exercises and exam questions along with
longdesc their solutions. The package features mechanisms to hide or
longdesc postpone solutions, to assign and handle points, to collect
longdesc problems on exercise sheets, to store and use metadata, and to
longdesc implement a consistent numbering. It also provides a very
longdesc flexible interface for configuring and customising the
longdesc formatting, layout, and representation of the exercise content.
